fighting.

- I hear noises. Sirius has engaged the ants. I concentrate on
whatevers coming through the doorway.

- Fire more arrows. I'm out of ammunition. Just daggers left now.

- Black pudding! What's this thing doing here? It touches me.
Something happens to something in my inventory. I make it eat daggers.

- Step back into the room. Something stands in front of me (a barrow
