- No more ammo of any kind. I hit "x" and start lunging with old
faithful; the +1 elven dagger.

- Lot's of bodies everywhere. I can see walls.

- There's something slow moving over in a corner. I run towards it and
just keep stabing it until it dies.

- I turn around and scan the room. Only a few monsters left;
leperchaun, dwarf lord, and some kind of mummy.

- I pick up a stack of arrows and some daggers. I gun them all down.

- The leperchaun is the last to fall. He leaves a mountain of gold.
Looks like he spent all his time just picking it all up.

- I faint. Fell to weak status at some point. 

- Wake up to a gecko nibbling on me. I kill it and eat some kind of
corpse from the pile I passed out on.

- Sirius is in the room near me. I go to look in the hallway. Don't
see anything that's moving.

- It's over.


  I save the game, switch off the computer for the night, and collapse
on the couch. I'm exhausted...

